   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Word machinery\nFactors {a, s, m, e}: t_a(theta_s + m h)^e. Bras are row vectors; spans are row-reduced exactly. Localisation on pair 1: the 256-vector is reshaped to 16x16 (pair 1 x pair 2) and required to lie in C^16 (x) w0, with w0 the pair-2 state of the reference.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "prRed[rows_] := DeleteCases[RowReduce[rows], {0 ..}];\nprInv[a_, u0_, fr_] := prInv[a, u0, fr] = Quiet[Check[LinearSolve[Transpose[prTm[a, u0, fr]]], $Failed]];\nprApplyF[{a_, s_, m_, e_}, X_, fr_] := Module[{u0 = prTh[[s]] + m prH}, If[e == 1, Normal[X . prTm[a, u0, fr]], Transpose[prInv[a, u0, fr][Transpose[X]]]]];\nprFacList[fr_, ss_, ms_: Range[-4, 4]] := Select[Flatten[Table[{a, s, m, e}, {a, 1, 3}, {s, ss}, {m, ms}, {e, {1, -1}}], 3], (#[[4]] == 1 || prInv[#[[1]], prTh[[#[[2]]]] + #[[3]] prH, fr] =!= $Failed) &];\nprSpan[om_, fr_, facs_] := Module[{S1, basis, X}, S1 = prRed[Join[{om}, Table[First@prApplyF[f, {om}, fr], {f, facs}]]]; basis = S1; Do[X = prApplyF[f, S1, fr]; basis = prRed[Join[basis, X]], {f, facs}]; basis];\nprLoc[B_, w0_] := Module[{Nn = NullSpace[{w0}], Cm, ns, psis, e = w0/(w0 . w0)}, Cm = Table[Flatten[ArrayReshape[b, {16, 16}] . Transpose[Nn]], {b, B}]; ns = NullSpace[Transpose[Cm]]; If[ns === {}, Return[{}]]; psis = ns . B; prRed[Table[ArrayReshape[p, {16, 16}] . e, {p, psis}]]];\nprRefs = <|\"R1\" -> <|\"fr\" -> \"diag\", \"v\" -> {1, 0, 0, 1/3}, \"u\" -> {-1/3, 0, 0, 1}|>, \"R2\" -> <|\"fr\" -> \"diag\", \"v\" -> {2, -1, 3, 5}, \"u\" -> {3, 2, 1, -7/5}|>|>;\nprVw = Table[{3/2, 9/8, 3/7, 5/9}[[i]]^(4 - j), {i, 4}, {j, 4}];\nprRefs[\"R3\"] = <|\"fr\" -> \"comp\", \"v\" -> prVw[[1]], \"u\" -> Inverse[prVw][[All, 4]]|>;\nprOm[r_] := Flatten[Outer[Times, r[\"v\"], r[\"u\"], r[\"v\"], r[\"u\"]]];\nprW0[r_] := Flatten[Outer[Times, r[\"v\"], r[\"u\"]]];\nGrid[Table[{k, prRefs[k][\"fr\"], prRefs[k][\"v\"] . prRefs[k][\"u\"], prRefs[k][\"u\"] . prGm[prRefs[k][\"fr\"]] . prRefs[k][\"v\"], prRefs[k][\"u\"] . Transpose[prGm[prRefs[k][\"fr\"]]] . prRefs[k][\"v\"]}, {k, {\"R1\", \"R2\", \"R3\"}}] // Prepend[#, {\"ref\", \"frame\", \"v.u\", \"u.G.v\", \"u.G^T.v\"}] &, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
