  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Span of words on R1/R2/R3 (t1,t2,t3 at theta_{1,2} + m h, m=-4..4, exponents +-1, products of up to 2 factors)\nReports dim S (span of all word bras) and dim S12 (pair-1-localised subspace), with the basis of S12 as 4x4 matrices x[A,F].",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "prRun[k_] := Module[{r = prRefs[k], fr, facs, t, B, xs}, fr = r[\"fr\"]; facs = prFacList[fr, {1, 2}]; t = AbsoluteTiming[B = prSpan[prOm[r], fr, facs]; xs = prLoc[B, prW0[r]];]; prSp[k] = B; prX[k] = xs; {k, Length[facs], Length[B], Length[xs], Round[t[[1]]]}];\nprRes1 = prRun[\"R1\"];\nGrid[{{\"ref\", \"#factors\", \"dim S\", \"dim S12\", \"seconds\"}, prRes1}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
