  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## R1 analysis: basis of S12 (4x4 matrices x[A,F]) and membership of rotation targets\nNote: the kernel was shared and evaluations for R2/R3 with exact rationals were very slow/aborted (see later cells for a modular-arithmetic rerun of the dimension counts). R1 results here are exact.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "prR = prRefs[\"R1\"]; prv = prR[\"v\"]; pru = prR[\"u\"]; prLam = prGm[\"diag\"]; prXR1 = prX[\"R1\"];\nprVec[a_, b_] := Flatten[Outer[Times, a, b]];\nprIn[X_, x_] := MatrixRank[Append[X, x]] == MatrixRank[X];\nprDimInt[X_, F_] := MatrixRank[X] + MatrixRank[F] - MatrixRank[Join[X, F]];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{i, MatrixForm[ArrayReshape[prXR1[[i]], {4, 4}]], MatrixRank[ArrayReshape[prXR1[[i]], {4, 4}]]}, {i, Length[prXR1]}], {\"#\", \"x[A,F]\", \"rank\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
