  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## R1: which single-word bras localise; singles-only S12; membership table for rotation targets\nSingle localising words found by the scan (s=1 is the A site of pair 1, s=2 the F site): see grid. Then membership of the targets T_A..T_D, mixed pieces and powers of Lambda in (i) the full S12 (words up to length 2, with inverses) and (ii) the S12 obtained from single words only.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "prFacs1 = prFacList[\"diag\", {1, 2}];\nprSingB = prRed[Join[{prpsi0}, Table[First@prApplyF[f, {prpsi0}, \"diag\"], {f, prFacs1}]]];\nprXs = prLoc[prSingB, prw0];\nprI = IdentityMatrix[4]; prLami = Inverse[prLam];\nprD[k_] := prI - k prLam; prDi[k_] := prI - k prLami;\nprT4[k_] := {\"T_A  (v D) x (u D^-1)\" -> prVec[prv . prD[k], pru . Inverse[prD[k]]], \"T_B  (v D^-1) x (u D)\" -> prVec[prv . Inverse[prD[k]], pru . prD[k]], \"T_C  Lam^-1 version of A\" -> prVec[prv . prDi[k], pru . Inverse[prDi[k]]], \"T_D  Lam^-1 version of B\" -> prVec[prv . Inverse[prDi[k]], pru . prDi[k]], \"vD x u\" -> prVec[prv . prD[k], pru], \"v x uD\" -> prVec[prv, pru . prD[k]], \"v x uD^-1\" -> prVec[prv, pru . Inverse[prD[k]]], \"vD^-1 x u\" -> prVec[prv . Inverse[prD[k]], pru], \"v(1-kL^-1) x u\" -> prVec[prv . prDi[k], pru], \"v x u(1-kL^-1)\" -> prVec[prv, pru . prDi[k]]};\nprTab = Flatten[Table[Join[{kk, nm[[1]]}, {prIn[prXR1, nm[[2]]], prIn[prXs, nm[[2]]]}], {kk, {1/3, -2/5, 5/3}}, {nm, prT4[kk]}], 1];\nprPow = Join[Table[{\"v x u L^\" <> ToString[j], prIn[prXR1, prVec[prv, pru . MatrixPower[prLam, j]]], prIn[prXs, prVec[prv, pru . MatrixPower[prLam, j]]]}, {j, -3, 3}], Table[{\"v L^\" <> ToString[j] <> \" x u\", prIn[prXR1, prVec[prv . MatrixPower[prLam, j], pru]], prIn[prXs, prVec[prv . MatrixPower[prLam, j], pru]]}, {j, -3, 3}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"dims\", \"dim S12 full\", Length[prXR1], \"dim S12 singles-only\", Length[prXs], \"#singles\", Length[prFacs1]}}, {{\"kappa\", \"target\", \"in full S12\", \"in singles-only S12\"}}, prTab, {{\"piece\", \"in full S12\", \"in singles S12\"}}, prPow], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
