  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Modular (mod p = 2^31-1) rerun of the span / localisation dimension counts for R1, R2, R3\nExact rational RowReduce for R2/R3 was too slow on the shared kernel (aborted / >290 s). The same algorithm is run with all matrices reduced mod p = 2147483647 (RowReduce/Inverse with Modulus). Ranks are then exact up to a probability ~1/p of an accidental drop; R1 is cross-checked against the exact result (54, 6).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "prMd = 2147483647;\nprMq[q_] := Mod[Numerator[q] PowerMod[Denominator[q], -1, prMd], prMd];\nprTmM[a_, u0_, fr_] := prTmM[a, u0, fr] = Map[prMq, Normal[prTm[a, u0, fr]], {2}];\nprInvM[a_, u0_, fr_] := prInvM[a, u0, fr] = Quiet[Check[Inverse[prTmM[a, u0, fr], Modulus -> prMd], $Failed]];\nprRedM[rows_] := DeleteCases[RowReduce[rows, Modulus -> prMd], {0 ..}];\nprApplyFM[{a_, s_, m_, e_}, X_, fr_] := Module[{u0 = prTh[[s]] + m prH}, If[e == 1, Mod[X . prTmM[a, u0, fr], prMd], Mod[X . prInvM[a, u0, fr], prMd]]];\nprFacListM[fr_, ss_] := Select[Flatten[Table[{a, s, m, e}, {a, 1, 3}, {s, ss}, {m, -4, 4}, {e, {1, -1}}], 3], (#[[4]] == 1 || prInvM[#[[1]], prTh[[#[[2]]]] + #[[3]] prH, fr] =!= $Failed) &];\nprSpanM[om_, fr_, facs_] := Module[{S1, basis, X}, S1 = prRedM[Join[{om}, Table[First@prApplyFM[f, {om}, fr], {f, facs}]]]; basis = S1; Do[X = prApplyFM[f, S1, fr]; basis = prRedM[Join[basis, X]], {f, facs}]; basis];\nprLocM[B_, w0_] := Module[{Nn = NullSpace[{w0}, Modulus -> prMd], Cm, ns, psis, e = Mod[w0 PowerMod[w0 . w0, -1, prMd], prMd]}, Cm = Table[Flatten[Mod[ArrayReshape[b, {16, 16}] . Transpose[Nn], prMd]], {b, B}]; ns = NullSpace[Transpose[Cm], Modulus -> prMd]; If[ns === {}, Return[{}]]; psis = Mod[ns . B, prMd]; prRedM[Table[Mod[ArrayReshape[p, {16, 16}] . e, prMd], {p, psis}]]];\nprRunM[k_] := Module[{r = prRefs[k], fr, facs, om, w0, B, xs, t}, fr = r[\"fr\"]; om = Map[prMq, prOm[r]]; w0 = Map[prMq, prW0[r]]; facs = prFacListM[fr, {1, 2}]; t = AbsoluteTiming[B = prSpanM[om, fr, facs]; xs = prLocM[B, w0];]; prSpM[k] = B; prXM[k] = xs; {k, Length[facs], Length[B], Length[xs], Round[t[[1]]]}];\nprMres1 = prRunM[\"R1\"];\nGrid[{{\"ref\", \"#factors\", \"dim S (mod p)\", \"dim S12 (mod p)\", \"seconds\"}, prMres1}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"213\" data-out-n=\"1834\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"19\" data-sub-start=\"11\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1834]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfGN8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtyZWZ9ICYgXHRleHR7XCNmYWN0b3JzfSAmIFx0ZXh0e2RpbSBTIChtb2QgcCl9ICYgXHRleHR7ZGltIFMxMiAobW9kIHApfSAmIFx0ZXh0e3NlY29uZHN9XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtSMX0gJiAxMDIgJiA1NCAmIDYgJiAxXFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ref</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">#factors</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">102</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim S (mod p)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">54</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim S12 (mod p)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">seconds</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
