  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Word-coefficient extraction on R1 (exact)\nWe look for the sparsest word combination (single factors t_a(theta_s + m h)^{+-1}, identity coefficient normalised to 1) whose bra equals lambda * T (x) w0 for a rotation target T. Sparse support is found by an L1 linear program (numerical), then the coefficients are recomputed exactly on that support.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "prWords = Join[{{{0, 0, 0, 0}, prpsi0}}, Table[{f, First@prApplyF[f, {prpsi0}, \"diag\"]}, {f, prFacs1}]];\nprWM = Transpose[prWords[[All, 2]]]; prWMn = N[prWM];\nprSearch[tvec_, k_] := Module[{tt = N@Flatten@Outer[Times, tvec, prw0], n = Length[prWords], b, out},\n b = -prWMn[[All, 1]];\n out = Reap[Do[With[{A = Transpose[Append[Transpose[prWMn[[All, sub]]], -tt]]}, With[{x = Quiet@LeastSquares[A, b]}, If[Norm[A . x - b]/Norm[b] < 10^-9, Sow[{sub, x}]]]], {sub, Subsets[Range[2, n], {k}]}]][[2]];\n If[out === {}, {}, out[[1]]]];\nprShow[res_] := Map[{prWords[[#[[1]], 1]], #[[2]]} &, res];\nprT1 = prVec[prv . prD[1/3], pru . Inverse[prD[1/3]]];\n{AbsoluteTiming[prSearch[prT1, 1]], AbsoluteTiming[Length[prSearch[prT1, 2]]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"215\" data-out-n=\"1844\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"21\" data-sub-start=\"8\" data-sub-end=\"8\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1844]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue3BtYXRyaXh9MC4wNDczNjAxICYgXHtcfVxcMS4zMDU2MDIxICYgMFxlbmR7cG1hdHJpeH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.0473601</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.3056021</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">{</