  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Individually localised two-factor words on R1\nAll products t_a(.)^{e} t_b(.)^{e'} (unordered, incl. squares) of the 102 allowed factors are applied to psi0; those whose bra is already of the form x (x) w0 are kept with their x[A,F] matrices.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "prNn = NullSpace[{prw0}]; prE0 = prw0/(prw0 . prw0);\nprLocalQ[row_] := AllTrue[Flatten[ArrayReshape[row, {16, 16}] . Transpose[prNn]], # === 0 &];\nprPairL = Reap[Do[With[{X = prApplyF[prFacs1[[j]], prWords[[2 ;; j + 1, 2]], \"diag\"]}, Do[If[prLocalQ[X[[i]]], Sow[{{prFacs1[[i]], prFacs1[[j]]}, X[[i]]}]], {i, Length[X]}]], {j, Length[prFacs1]}]][[2]];\nprPairL = If[prPairL === {}, {}, prPairL[[1]]];\nGrid[{{\"# localised two-factor words\", Length[prPairL]}, {\"# with x != 0\", Count[prPairL, _?(Norm[#[[2]]] =!= 0 &)]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"216\" data-out-n=\"1849\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"23\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1849]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtcIyBsb2NhbGlzZWQgdHdvLWZhY3RvciB3b3Jkc30gJiA2NTdcXFxobGluZVx0ZXh0e1wjIHdpdGggeCAhPSAwfSAmIDYwXFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># localised two-factor words</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># with x != 0</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class