  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Sparse searches in the localised-word x-space (R1)\nXL = x-matrices of psi0, all individually localised single words and all individually localised two-factor words (nonzero x). For a target t we look for combinations x0 + sum_i c_i x_i = lambda t with at most k words (numerical least squares screening; hits are then re-solved exactly).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "prXL = Join[{{{}, Flatten[Outer[Times, prv, pru]]}}, Select[Table[{{prWords[[i, 1]]}, Flatten[ArrayReshape[prWords[[i, 2]], {16, 16}] . prE0]}, {i, 2, Length[prWords]}], Norm[#[[2]]] =!= 0 &], Select[Table[{p[[1]], Flatten[ArrayReshape[p[[2]], {16, 16}] . prE0]}, {p, prPairL}], Norm[#[[2]]] =!= 0 &]];\nprXLn = N[Transpose[prXL[[All, 2]]]];\nprSX[tvec_, k_] := Module[{tt = N[tvec], b = -prXLn[[All, 1]], n = Length[prXL], out},\n out = Reap[Do[With[{A = Transpose[Append[Transpose[prXLn[[All, sub]]], -tt]]}, With[{x = Quiet@LeastSquares[A, b]}, If[Norm[A . x - b]/Norm[b] < 10^-9, Sow[{sub, x}]]]], {sub, Subsets[Range[2, n], {k}]}]][[2]];\n If[out === {}, {}, out[[1]]]];\nGrid[{{\"# words in XL (incl psi0)\", Length[prXL]}, {\"rank of XL x-space\", MatrixRank[prXL[[All, 2]]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"217\" data-out-n=\"1853\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"25\" data-sub-start=\"5\" data-sub-end=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1853]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtcIyB3b3JkcyBpbiBYTCAoaW5jbCBwc2kwKX0gJiAxNTdcXFxobGluZVx0ZXh0e3Jhbmsgb2YgWEwgeC1zcGFjZX0gJiA2XFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># words in XL (incl psi0)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank of XL x-space</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">157</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
