  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## One-point generating function on the F site of pair 1 (R1)\npsi0 t2(theta2) = psi0 t3(theta2) = 0 on R1 (x = 0), so F_kappa(theta2; 0,0,0) = 1 - kappa t1(theta2) on R1. Its x[A,F] is linear in kappa: a rank-2 block on the {1,4}x{1,4} indices plus (949 kappa/33600)(E22 + E33).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "prxx = Function[w, ArrayReshape[ArrayReshape[w, {16, 16}] . prE0, {4, 4}]];\nprxk = prxx[prpsi0] - k prxx[prb[1, 2, 0]] + k^2 prxx[prb[2, 2, 0]] - k^3 prxx[prb[3, 2, 0]];\nGrid[{{\"x(kappa)\", MatrixForm[Factor /@ prxk]}, {\"det of {1,4} block\", Factor[Det[prxk[[{1, 4}, {1, 4}]]]]}, {\"ranks at kappa=1/3,-2/5,5/3\", Table[MatrixRank[prxk /. k -> kk], {kk, {1/3, -2/5, 5/3}}]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"218\" data-out-n=\"1856\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"27\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1856]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.5784em;vertical-align:-3.5192em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.0592em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.0192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.0192em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.5384em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.5192em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.0192em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.0192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.7302em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">x(kappa)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.771em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.7302em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">det of {1,4} block</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.571em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.7302em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ranks at kappa=1/3,-2/5,5/3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\